<main class="page-main info-page">
  <header class="info-header">
    <h1>FAQ</h1>
    <p class="info-subtitle">
      Quick answers to common questions about orders, shipping, and crystals.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="info-card faq-card">
    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

    <dl class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <dt>Do you really sell crystals?</dt>
        <dd>
          Yes. RockBay offers a curated collection of crystals, fossils, minerals,
          and bundles. Inventory on the site reflects what is currently available,
          but some pieces are one-of-a-kind and can sell out quickly.
        </dd>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <dt>Where do you ship from and how long does it take?</dt>
        <dd>
          Orders are packed and shipped from within the United States. Most
          packages leave our studio in 2–3 business days. Standard U.S. delivery
          usually arrives in 3–7 business days depending on your location and
          carrier delays.
        </dd>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <dt>How are the crystals packaged?</dt>
        <dd>
          Each item is wrapped in protective padding and then boxed to limit
          movement in transit. Fragile clusters and fossils receive extra
          cushioning so they arrive safely.
        </dd>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <dt>What is your return or exchange policy?</dt>
        <dd>
          If an item arrives damaged or not as described, contact us within
          7 days of delivery with photos of the package and item. We’ll work with
          you on a replacement, store credit, or refund depending on the situation.
        </dd>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <dt>Are the crystals natural or man-made?</dt>
        <dd>
          Unless clearly marked otherwise, our stones are natural specimens from
          trusted suppliers. Many pieces are lightly polished or shaped, but the
          color and structure come from the crystal itself.
        </dd>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <dt>Do you include meanings or care instructions?</dt>
        <dd>
          Yes. Each product page includes common associations and basic care tips
          (for example, stones that should be kept away from water or sunlight).
          These are for general guidance only and are not a substitute for
          professional advice.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </section>
</main>
